</figure>
<p>My favorite aspect of this new easter egg of a feature is that with the light off, you can&#8217;t tell that it&#8217;s the new MacBook Pro. It doesn&#8217;t look like the white logo cut-out of years past; it looks exactly like the mirrored metallic logos of the last decade. Except&#8230; then it lights up. Magic indeed.</p>
